roup-type="author"><name><surname>Eng</surname><given-names>TR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Population health technologies. Emerging innovations for the health of the public</article-title><source>Amer. J. Prev. Med</source><year>2004</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>237</fpage><lpage>242</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15026105</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b26-ijerph-06-01204"><label>26.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Von Schirnding</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Health sustainable development: can we rise to the challenge?</article-title><source>The Lancet</source><year>2002</year><volume>360</volume><fpage>632</fpage><lpage>637</lpage></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>